5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I worry about us not speaking after this. Let's pick something that keeps the peace.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I just want a corner we can walk past without holding our breath in August.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need to know the hours this takes. I refuse to guess at the workload.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,Why does one house always get the gate? I want a fair look at the burden.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We must add up the costs first. Five budgets, one bill. Let's be clear.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, fair is good, but I fear it causes more fights than it solves.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I agree. Peace is precious. Let's find a gentle solution for everyone.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, costs are part of the hours. I need both numbers to judge.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, hours are fine, but if the work is uneven, the hours don't matter.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, well said. Let us look at the ledger and the subsidy together.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the complaint log. I want to see who is actually unhappy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will visit the station block. I want to see what their bin house is like.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the supervised mornings. I need to know the time commitment.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will measure the frontages. I want to see if the space is truly equal.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,I will check the ward subsidy and the block ledger. I need the financial picture.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
