35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The log shows one house filed eleven of fourteen complaints. That explains the tension.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The station bin house smells worse by midsummer. And they argue over sweeping.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Asuka,,Supervised mornings take fifty minutes. The truck arrives before some of us wake.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Rin,,Two frontages are too narrow for a bay. One is crossed by a driveway.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The subsidy covers only forty percent. The ledger shows thirty-four thousand yen in waste.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if the space is uneven, rotation might be impossible.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, if the truck comes early, who watches? I worry about the burden.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, the hours are fixed. We must plan for the early wake-up.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Kenji, exactly. We cannot rotate if the land doesn't fit.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, the cost is high. We need a structure that lasts, not just a shift.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"I think a permanent structure might be best, if we can afford it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shizue,,But the station one smells. A permanent one might be worse if not maintained.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Asuka,,A permanent one requires a site plan and four months. That is a long wait.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Rin,,"If we build, we must ensure the gate isn't just for one house.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"The subsidy helps, but we still pay sixty percent. We must be careful.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
