73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I vote for A. It is fair if we share the burden.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,I vote for A. It is the most sustainable.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
